<h1>Idea Wellness</h1>
<div class="bar"></div>
<p>
    Idea Wellness is a premium gym and wellness service with branches in
    <strong>Sheraton Heliopolis</strong>, <strong>New Cairo</strong>, and the
    <strong>North Coast (Ramla North Coast)</strong>. We help members train,
    track their progress, and manage their membership — in the gym and on their phone.
</p>

<h2>The Idea Wellness member app</h2>
<p>
    Members use the Idea Wellness mobile app to:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>View their membership, packages, and remaining sessions</li>
    <li>See today's classes and the weekly schedule</li>
    <li>Check in at the gym by scanning a branch QR code</li>
    <li>Browse the exercise library and build workout plans</li>
    <li>Track rewards and gym activity</li>
</ul>

<h2>Your data &amp; privacy</h2>
<p>
    We collect only the information needed to run your membership and deliver
    these services — such as your name, email, phone number, membership details,
    and attendance. We do not sell your personal information. Read the full
    <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.
</p>

